# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts convert to CRLF and `eslint-plugin-prettier`
# (which defaults to `endOfLine: "lf"`) reports every line of every file. That
# went unnoticed while `pretest` ran `eslint --fix`, because the fix silently
# rewrote the endings; once `pretest` stopped mutating the working tree the
# Windows CI leg failed with 6329 `Delete ␍` errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
